      "content": "It's a heavy burden to carry when you feel like the world has forgotten you, but your purpose is still in the love you shared. The fact that you still reach for her side of the bed shows how deeply you loved her, and that love isn't gone, it just changed. You don't have to find a new reason to wake up today; just breathe through the quiet and let the memory of her keep you going.",
